---
import { SITE } from '../consts';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <svg class="footer-wave" viewBox="0 0 1440 90" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M0 44c120-30 240 30 360 30s240-60 360-60 240 60 360 60 240-60 360-30v46H0z"
      fill="currentColor"></path>
  </svg>
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <a class="brand" href="/">
          <svg class="brand-mark" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M16 2.6c4.6 6.2 9 10.4 9 15.4a9 9 0 0 1-18 0c0-5 4.4-9.2 9-15.4z" fill="#2f86c9"></path>
            <circle cx="14" cy="18.4" r="1.5" fill="#fff"></circle>
          </svg>
          <span class="brand-text">
            芙宁娜的花园
            <small>Furina · Hydro</small>
          </span>
        </a>
        <p>「水会记得一切。即使是那些你希望它忘记的。」<br />这里存放被水记住的字。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>浏览</h4>
        <ul>
          {SITE.nav.map((item) => <li><a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a></li>)}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>订阅与源</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/rss.xml">RSS 订阅</a></li>
          <li><a href="/sitemap-index.xml">站点地图</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/desthon" rel="noopener">GitHub</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <span>© {year} {SITE.author} · 以 <span class="gold">Astro</span> 建造，以水命名</span>
      <span>枫丹 · 芙宁娜 / Focalors</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
